      "source": [
        "# \ud83d\ude80 0XARTEX/artex-coder-7b - OpenAI-Compatible Cloud Inference Server\n",
        "Run this in Google Colab (Free T4 or A100 GPU) to serve the model as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint for **Antigravity (`agy`)**, **Google Agents CLI (`agents-cli`)**, and **ARTEX Swarm**."
      ]
    },
    {
